[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0010","text":"……啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0020","text":"……嗯？\n怎么了凛世？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0030","text":"那边……\n有鬼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0040","text":"诶？\n鬼、鬼……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0050","text":"什么嘛\n是万圣节的装饰啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0060","text":"呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0070","text":"────噢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0080","text":"你看，凛世\n写着『期间限定·南瓜馒头』呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0090","text":"……那个也是……\n万圣节相关的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0100","text":"是吧\n商店街的人，挺用心的嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31200100_01_0002","text":"Motion"}]
